WEBVTT

00:11.545 --> 00:14.981
Hanaukyo Maid Team

00:15.549 --> 00:21.510
Asa no mado wo aketanara.

00:21.588 --> 00:28.152
Hikari no hana
sekai wo tsutsumu.

00:29.196 --> 00:35.101
Mune no naka ni nemutte iru...

00:35.168 --> 00:42.336
...omoi ga ima tokete ikuyou.

00:43.176 --> 00:48.079
Kisetsu no nioi dakishimeteru.

00:49.549 --> 00:55.784
Anata ni negatte...

00:55.856 --> 00:58.791
Aitakatta...

00:58.859 --> 01:02.590
...umareta hi kara zutto.

01:02.662 --> 01:05.529
Anata hitori...

01:05.599 --> 01:09.968
...mamoritai hito ga iru.

01:10.036 --> 01:12.300
Anata dake...

01:12.372 --> 01:14.431
...furetai.

01:15.709 --> 01:20.737
Kono te wo tsunaguno.

01:22.482 --> 01:24.245
Todoketai.

01:25.852 --> 01:28.218
Voice of my heart.

01:45.972 --> 01:47.337
Mariel...

01:52.646 --> 01:54.671
It's my fault, isn't it?

02:00.287 --> 02:02.687
Cynthia, you'd better rest for a while.

02:06.092 --> 02:07.559
Me?

02:07.627 --> 02:08.787
I'm all right.

02:10.063 --> 02:11.030
I'll...

02:15.135 --> 02:16.830
...stay beside Mariel.

02:16.903 --> 02:21.806
Blue Silent Bell

02:23.209 --> 02:29.148
Blood test, DNA analysis,
brain MRI, and brain MRA.

02:30.717 --> 02:32.947
We did everything we could...

02:33.019 --> 02:37.319
We can't specify anything except
some psychogenetic cause.

02:39.192 --> 02:40.250
I see.

02:40.327 --> 02:43.728
But there is some
data that concerns us.

02:43.797 --> 02:44.764
In fact...

02:51.504 --> 02:56.168
We haven't gotten conclusive
evidence, but if that's the truth...

02:57.177 --> 02:58.940
Does Taro-sama know?

02:59.012 --> 03:00.274
No, not yet.

03:02.349 --> 03:03.816
T-Taro-sama.

03:03.883 --> 03:06.545
Is something wrong
with Mariel-sama?

03:06.620 --> 03:07.609
No.

03:07.687 --> 03:11.453
I took Cynthia to her bedroom
because she fell asleep.

03:11.524 --> 03:14.186
So are Mariel's
medical exam results in?

03:14.260 --> 03:15.784
Y-Yes...

03:17.330 --> 03:19.025
It's bad, isn't it...

03:19.099 --> 03:23.297
To be honest, we don't
even know if she's sick...

03:24.738 --> 03:25.705
But...

03:26.706 --> 03:28.435
"But..." What's the matter?

03:30.677 --> 03:31.803
It's nothing.

03:31.878 --> 03:35.507
Luckily, her condition
seems to be stable.

03:35.582 --> 03:37.550
Please rest for a while, too.

03:45.492 --> 03:46.618
Is this okay?

03:49.429 --> 03:52.125
The medical staff
has noticed it too, right?

03:52.198 --> 03:53.563
Blue Silent Bell.

03:54.534 --> 03:57.594
I'm not trying to complain
about your methods.

03:57.671 --> 04:00.799
But kindness
sometimes hurts people.

04:05.245 --> 04:08.078
T-Then they can't
give her any treatment?

04:09.215 --> 04:10.182
No...

04:11.151 --> 04:12.846
It can't be...

04:12.919 --> 04:14.284
It's all right.

04:14.354 --> 04:15.548
It's for times like this...

04:15.622 --> 04:18.284
...that the tech staff
was gathering power...

04:18.358 --> 04:20.417
...and completing
a medical machine.

04:21.461 --> 04:22.428
Come on!

04:22.495 --> 04:23.519
Stop!

04:24.130 --> 04:26.360
This is a serious situation.

04:26.433 --> 04:28.094
It's not time to play.

04:28.168 --> 04:30.830
I-I wasn't playing...

04:30.904 --> 04:34.271
First of all, you lack
seriousness, Ikuyo-senpai.

04:34.340 --> 04:36.831
I-I'm sorry, Sanae-chan...

04:36.910 --> 04:38.878
Sanae is my last name!

04:38.945 --> 04:41.014
My first name is Yashima!
In any case,
it's a persistent rain, huh?

04:41.014 --> 04:41.815
Sorry, Sanae-chan.
In any case,
it's a persistent rain, huh?

04:41.815 --> 04:42.315
Sorry, Sanae-chan.
Yeah.

04:42.315 --> 04:42.816
Like I said...
Yeah.

04:42.816 --> 04:43.544
Like I said...

04:44.184 --> 04:45.674
It's all right.

04:45.752 --> 04:48.186
All rain stops falling eventually.

04:59.632 --> 05:01.361
S-Shikoh-ln-sama!

05:01.434 --> 05:02.799
Why are you here?

05:04.571 --> 05:07.506
The order's been issued
by Hokusai-sama.

05:07.574 --> 05:11.533
As for this matter, I will be
in full command starting now.

05:21.354 --> 05:22.321
Leader.

05:23.690 --> 05:25.385
Leader!

05:25.458 --> 05:27.016
W-What?

05:27.093 --> 05:28.993
Intruders detected in Block B8.

05:29.062 --> 05:31.360
Identities unknown.
Vital signs unknown.

05:31.431 --> 05:33.058
What?

05:33.133 --> 05:34.691
Starting mansion tracking system.

05:34.768 --> 05:37.862
5, 4, 3, 2...

05:37.937 --> 05:39.632
Starting to track targets.

05:40.540 --> 05:41.632
What's wrong?

05:41.708 --> 05:44.074
Intruders detected
in Block C3, too!

05:44.144 --> 05:48.080
Not good. There are intruders
in Blocks F5, B0, and H9, too.

05:48.148 --> 05:52.585
The number of intruders
has exceeded 20... 30... 40.

05:52.652 --> 05:54.142
It can't be...

05:54.220 --> 05:57.678
Breaking the Hanaukyo family's
security network so easily...

05:57.757 --> 05:59.554
The intruders have begun to move.

06:00.126 --> 06:01.923
Simulating destination.

06:01.995 --> 06:03.326
Projected destination...

06:03.396 --> 06:04.920
It can't be!

06:04.998 --> 06:06.727
It's the room Mariel-sama is in!

06:06.800 --> 06:09.064
Security Units 4 and 5...

06:09.135 --> 06:12.627
...engaging intruders in 15
seconds and entering purge mode.

06:12.705 --> 06:13.729
Stop them!

06:15.041 --> 06:17.271
Even if we fight,
there's no chance of winning.

06:18.077 --> 06:19.044
Leader...

06:20.680 --> 06:21.544
Sister...

06:30.957 --> 06:32.390
I swear...

06:32.458 --> 06:34.221
Hey, you guys, don't sleep!

06:34.294 --> 06:35.625
Taro-sama's been...

06:35.695 --> 06:37.595
Let them sleep.

06:37.664 --> 06:39.757
All right...

06:39.833 --> 06:41.460
I'll bring everyone blankets.

06:41.534 --> 06:44.264
No, the family
head can't do that...

06:44.337 --> 06:47.101
But everyone will
catch a cold like this.

06:47.173 --> 06:49.038
I'm sure next door...

06:52.979 --> 06:53.946
Are you all right?

06:55.014 --> 06:56.641
Taro-sama...

06:56.716 --> 06:58.047
Please escape...

06:59.152 --> 07:01.017
H-Hey, hold on...

07:01.087 --> 07:01.883
Taro-sama.

07:04.023 --> 07:06.048
Taro-sama, stay inside.

07:06.125 --> 07:07.183
B-But...

07:07.260 --> 07:10.593
Mariel-sama hasn't
regained consciousness.

07:10.663 --> 07:12.153
I'll manage here somehow.

07:12.866 --> 07:16.097
Please protect
Mariel-sama with the others.

07:16.169 --> 07:17.466
I understand.

07:30.049 --> 07:31.448
Who are you?

07:33.219 --> 07:34.686
Let me pass.

07:35.722 --> 07:36.689
I refuse to.

08:05.218 --> 08:07.186
I don't know who you are...

08:07.253 --> 08:09.813
...but I won't let you lay
a finger on Taro-sama!

08:14.127 --> 08:15.355
W-What's so funny?

08:31.277 --> 08:34.178
If you resist further, I'll kill you.

08:36.749 --> 08:37.909
Stop!

08:40.019 --> 08:41.418
Leader...

08:47.961 --> 08:49.428
L-Leader...

08:53.032 --> 08:54.624
Taro-sama!

08:54.701 --> 08:55.963
And Mariel-sama!

08:56.035 --> 08:57.832
We'll protect them at any cost!

08:57.904 --> 09:01.362
Somehow, it seems
to have gotten quiet outside.

09:04.143 --> 09:06.475
Taro-sama, it's me.

09:06.546 --> 09:08.275
Would you please open the door?

09:09.349 --> 09:10.611
It's Konoe-san.

09:15.254 --> 09:16.380
Konoe-san.

09:18.324 --> 09:21.293
Taro-sama,
please step away from there.

09:22.762 --> 09:24.491
We will hand Mariel over.

09:24.564 --> 09:26.156
Konoe-san...

09:26.232 --> 09:28.166
Who is that person?

09:28.835 --> 09:32.532
Hokusai Hanaukyo-sama's
bodyguard and hunting soldier...

09:32.605 --> 09:36.336
...Shikoh-ln-sama
of the Red King Flag.

09:37.110 --> 09:38.805
Shikoh-ln...

09:38.878 --> 09:42.109
The previous master
desires Mariel's retrieval.

09:42.181 --> 09:44.240
Please hand her over at once.

09:44.317 --> 09:46.114
I-It can't be...

09:52.058 --> 09:54.026
W-Wait a minute...

09:59.399 --> 10:00.798
Hey!

10:00.867 --> 10:02.391
Can't you hear me?

10:02.468 --> 10:03.628
Wait...

10:03.703 --> 10:05.261
I'll take care of her...

10:05.338 --> 10:05.963
Everyone!

10:06.039 --> 10:08.166
Rescue Mariel!

10:08.841 --> 10:09.967
What's the matter?

10:10.043 --> 10:11.772
I'm sorry.

10:11.844 --> 10:14.210
The previous master's
will is absolute.

10:14.280 --> 10:16.214
We can't disobey his wishes...

10:16.282 --> 10:17.681
No...

10:20.053 --> 10:21.111
Taro-sama!

10:26.826 --> 10:28.259
Mariel...

10:28.327 --> 10:29.294
Wait!

10:32.198 --> 10:33.358
Taro-sama!

10:34.400 --> 10:36.027
Konoe-san, let go!

10:36.102 --> 10:37.160
Taro-sama!

10:37.236 --> 10:38.828
Let go!

10:38.905 --> 10:40.202
Let me go!

10:41.641 --> 10:44.166
Please understand, Taro-sama!

10:45.211 --> 10:46.178
Let go!

10:50.016 --> 10:51.040
Wait!

10:51.751 --> 10:52.718
Mariel...

10:53.786 --> 10:55.151
Mariel!

10:55.288 --> 10:56.687
Mariel!

10:56.989 --> 10:59.014
Mariel!

11:06.833 --> 11:07.800
Why...

11:10.069 --> 11:11.969
Konoe-san, why?

11:13.539 --> 11:15.507
Because we can't fix her here.

11:16.676 --> 11:18.041
Mariel...

11:18.111 --> 11:19.442
...is special.

11:19.512 --> 11:20.979
Grace!

11:21.047 --> 11:23.242
It's useless hiding it anymore, right?

11:23.316 --> 11:26.945
Besides, he has the right
and obligation to know everything...

11:27.019 --> 11:28.680
...as the Hanaukyo family's head.

11:28.754 --> 11:29.914
Am I wrong?

11:33.993 --> 11:35.051
Come on.

11:35.128 --> 11:37.926
I'll tell you what Mariel is.

11:41.067 --> 11:45.868
Hanaukyo Maid Team

11:48.040 --> 11:50.201
All right, listen calmly.

11:50.276 --> 11:53.837
You may not be able
to believe what I'm about to say.

11:53.913 --> 11:54.937
But it's all true.

11:59.018 --> 11:59.985
This is...

12:00.052 --> 12:01.747
It's Mariel.

12:01.821 --> 12:02.913
Mariel?

12:02.989 --> 12:05.685
She was created by
manipulating genes...

12:05.758 --> 12:08.056
...and born from
an artificial womb.

12:08.127 --> 12:10.186
To become your doll.

12:11.097 --> 12:13.065
My doll?

12:14.100 --> 12:16.091
Blue Silent Bell...

12:16.169 --> 12:18.194
Blue Silent Bell.

12:18.271 --> 12:21.638
That's the production plan's
code name for Mariel...

12:21.707 --> 12:24.267
...Taro Hanaukyo's
exclusive maid.

12:25.311 --> 12:26.437
Mariel...

12:37.056 --> 12:41.049
There is one thing that you
cannot forget at any time.

12:41.127 --> 12:42.094
Do you understand?

12:42.161 --> 12:45.790
Yes, it's about
Taro Hanaukyo-sama.

12:45.865 --> 12:49.130
Exactly. What kind
of person is Taro-sama?

12:49.202 --> 12:50.567
Um...

12:51.604 --> 12:54.072
He's the master Mariel serves.

12:54.874 --> 12:55.841
That's wrong.

12:57.877 --> 13:00.345
He is the master that I serve.

13:01.681 --> 13:02.773
Well done.

13:04.217 --> 13:05.514
Since her birth...

13:05.585 --> 13:09.214
...she's been taught that
her master was Taro-sama.

13:09.288 --> 13:11.848
Gently, gently...

13:18.564 --> 13:19.553
Done!

13:24.036 --> 13:24.968
Please.

13:25.738 --> 13:29.367
She received training to be
a maid just for Taro-sama.

13:36.682 --> 13:39.981
May I ask you one question?

13:40.052 --> 13:41.644
What is it?

13:41.721 --> 13:45.851
Why do I have to become a maid?

13:55.768 --> 13:58.828
Sometimes,
she received mind control.

13:58.904 --> 14:01.134
That can't be...

14:01.207 --> 14:05.166
Mariel's own will and
feelings were suppressed.

14:05.244 --> 14:09.305
To just fulfill your desires, make
you happy, and give you comfort.

14:10.283 --> 14:12.774
She was created to think only that.

14:13.819 --> 14:15.343
But you demanded...

14:15.421 --> 14:21.690
...that she express the feelings
and emotions she denies most.

14:21.761 --> 14:23.353
That's why...

14:23.429 --> 14:27.126
Mariel's mind couldn't cope
with the demand and...

14:28.167 --> 14:29.134
...broke down.

14:31.904 --> 14:36.967
That's why deeper mind control
is the only way to cure Mariel.

14:38.010 --> 14:40.308
At the previous master's place.

14:40.379 --> 14:42.438
Then Mariel is...

14:42.515 --> 14:45.177
I'm sure she'll be back
after a short while.

14:45.251 --> 14:48.812
As a better doll
that lives only for you.

14:56.228 --> 14:57.195
Taro-sama...

15:00.733 --> 15:02.098
I'm sorry.

15:02.168 --> 15:04.534
I yelled without
knowing your feelings.

15:05.571 --> 15:06.538
No...

15:07.840 --> 15:10.206
I should've realized
if I had thought a little.

15:11.711 --> 15:15.203
That such convenient
people don't exist.

15:15.281 --> 15:16.805
Taro-sama...

15:16.882 --> 15:19.077
I didn't have any doubt!

15:19.151 --> 15:21.210
I was flattered to be the head.

15:21.287 --> 15:25.189
Somewhere inside, I felt it was
natural for Mariel to serve me!

15:27.660 --> 15:29.992
I'm a fool...

15:31.097 --> 15:31.530
Taro-sama!

15:31.530 --> 15:32.264
Konoe!
Taro-sama!

15:32.264 --> 15:32.696
Konoe!

15:33.866 --> 15:35.697
The rest is up to him.

15:36.469 --> 15:39.461
How he accepts this fact
or how he responds...

15:39.538 --> 15:41.836
We'll just have to wait for it.

16:10.369 --> 16:12.200
It's this time already?

16:17.810 --> 16:18.834
Mariel...

16:30.823 --> 16:31.881
Taro-sama.

16:34.760 --> 16:37.422
Please tell me
your desire, Taro-sama.

16:40.199 --> 16:41.166
Mine?

16:41.934 --> 16:43.231
Yes.

16:43.302 --> 16:45.668
Your desire.

16:46.472 --> 16:47.439
My...

16:48.874 --> 16:50.865
My desire is...

17:07.359 --> 17:08.326
That's right...

17:09.328 --> 17:10.795
My desire is...

17:19.405 --> 17:21.805
Now is exactly the time to...

17:21.874 --> 17:23.273
...cheer up Taro-sama!

17:23.342 --> 17:24.309
Here goes!

17:25.644 --> 17:27.703
Personal staff member Lemon!

17:27.780 --> 17:28.678
Marron!

17:28.747 --> 17:29.372
Melon!

17:29.448 --> 17:32.713
With full energy,
we're here to serve...

17:32.785 --> 17:34.844
Good morning.
You're late today.

17:38.757 --> 17:42.249
I'm going to take a little walk,
so can you handle the rest?

17:43.696 --> 17:45.186
Y-Yes...

17:56.509 --> 17:58.477
It finally stopped raining.

17:59.879 --> 18:01.847
I thought all night afterwards.

18:02.882 --> 18:04.509
What should I do now?

18:05.551 --> 18:07.985
What's the best thing for Mariel?

18:09.588 --> 18:11.317
Did you find an answer?

18:12.558 --> 18:15.083
You might not call it
an answer, but...

18:16.262 --> 18:19.561
...there is one thing that I realized.

18:21.000 --> 18:23.059
I want to see Mariel's smile.

18:24.103 --> 18:25.730
Taro-sama...

18:25.804 --> 18:29.638
She may get well if she
goes to grandpa's place.

18:29.708 --> 18:32.575
But there's no point
if she stays a doll.

18:34.346 --> 18:35.313
Because I...

18:36.348 --> 18:38.282
Ever since I met Mariel...

18:38.350 --> 18:41.478
Ever since we first talked,
I've been wishing...

18:47.026 --> 18:49.221
I want to know her true feelings.

18:49.295 --> 18:51.627
I want to hear her true words.

18:51.697 --> 18:54.222
I want to see her true smile...

18:54.300 --> 18:57.064
That feeling hasn't
changed even now.

18:57.136 --> 18:58.103
That's why...

18:59.071 --> 19:00.402
That's why...

19:01.373 --> 19:02.863
...I'll get her back.

19:04.209 --> 19:06.769
If you defy
the previous master's will...

19:06.845 --> 19:09.871
...you may lose your
position as family head.

19:09.949 --> 19:11.109
I don't care.

19:11.684 --> 19:16.883
It's much better than losing
the dearest part of one's humanity.

19:17.823 --> 19:18.881
Taro-sama...

19:21.026 --> 19:22.323
I understand.

19:22.394 --> 19:24.385
If you're that determined...

19:28.801 --> 19:31.133
...I will go with you, too.

19:33.205 --> 19:35.901
But if you do that, you'll also...

19:36.508 --> 19:39.136
What can you do alone?

19:39.211 --> 19:41.736
You don't even know
Mariel's whereabouts.

19:42.581 --> 19:44.845
If so, leave it to me.

19:45.651 --> 19:46.618
Grace...

19:47.586 --> 19:49.747
I've checked it out with Memol.

19:49.822 --> 19:51.050
Really?

19:51.123 --> 19:52.351
Yeah.

19:52.424 --> 19:56.622
But take me along in return
for telling you, all right?

19:56.695 --> 19:58.094
You?

19:58.163 --> 19:59.289
It's unwise for a child.

19:59.365 --> 20:02.129
Don't lump me with the other brats!

20:02.201 --> 20:07.468
Besides, Mariel is close
to Cynthia's heart, too...

20:07.539 --> 20:09.097
That's right.

20:09.174 --> 20:12.632
All our feelings for
Mariel-sama are the same.

20:13.445 --> 20:15.436
Please take us with you, too.

20:15.514 --> 20:17.004
To rescue Mariel-sama.

20:17.082 --> 20:18.606
Everyone...

20:20.185 --> 20:21.652
That's true.

20:21.720 --> 20:23.244
Let's go together.

20:23.322 --> 20:24.482
To where Mariel is.

20:25.190 --> 20:26.122
Right!

20:32.965 --> 20:34.091
Now...

20:34.166 --> 20:34.996
Let's go!

20:36.468 --> 20:38.527
What is that outfit?

20:38.604 --> 20:42.335
Well, I thought this
would fire me up more...

20:42.408 --> 20:43.875
Taro-sama!

20:44.810 --> 20:46.402
Taro-sama...

20:46.478 --> 20:48.241
Please return safely
no matter what.

20:49.648 --> 20:51.445
But I'm no longer the head...

20:51.517 --> 20:53.508
No, please return.

20:54.219 --> 20:58.519
The entire Hanaukyo Maid Team
will sincerely be waiting for you!

21:00.726 --> 21:02.216
Everyone...

21:02.928 --> 21:04.862
Taro-sama, please hurry.

21:05.798 --> 21:07.026
Be right there!

21:08.567 --> 21:09.693
Well then...

21:22.648 --> 21:23.615
I'm off.

21:24.550 --> 21:25.881
Taro-sama...

21:27.352 --> 21:31.254
I'll return with Mariel
no matter what.

21:45.804 --> 21:49.103
Warera ni omakase kudasai.

21:49.174 --> 21:51.335
Hanaukyo Maid Tai.

21:52.377 --> 21:55.505
Osewa sasete itadakimasu.

21:55.581 --> 21:58.675
Osoba goyo tai.

21:58.751 --> 22:01.845
Oki ni mesuyouni tsuneni.

22:01.920 --> 22:04.150
Yaruki runrun nandesu.

22:05.190 --> 22:08.353
Kokoro to karada wo migaki.

22:08.427 --> 22:11.362
Goyou nannarito.

22:11.430 --> 22:22.898
Yorokonde yorokonde
hoshii dake desu.

22:24.109 --> 22:34.678
Sorenanoni sorenanoni
tsurenai ohito.

22:36.955 --> 22:43.053
Hoshiga hora kirei desu.

22:43.128 --> 22:48.725
